{"title":"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b67ed30668c7f5792d2e3205e42b0a57599df92.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((-5,0)--(5,0)--(2,14)--cycle,black+linewidth(.75)); draw((-2.25,5.5)--(4,14/3),black+linewidth(.75)); MP(&quot;A&quot;,(-5,0),S);MP(&quot;C&quot;,(5,0),S);MP(&quot;B&quot;,(2,14),N);MP(&quot;E&quot;,(4,14/3),E);MP(&quot;D&quot;,(-2.25,5.5),W); MP(&quot;55^\\circ&quot;,(-4.5,0),NE);MP(&quot;75^\\circ&quot;,(5,0),NW);  [/asy]\" width=\"168\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/9/009f69a0009a2bda2cf7a3b758c5654708e6a7d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A=55^\\circ$\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/9/6895a4753f9fee4450881197de12ceabbc0f7dd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C=75^\\circ, D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"16\" /> is on side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/3/1038b4876f3fe427c4815501f1e723ef7bc86843.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DB=BE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/1/841ca3ffca55aa7994464f8b6437b4fefede2003.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{BED} =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/8/db8470867d48638e5048f8bbb6e2883b46f1593a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 50^\\circ\\quad \\text{(B) } 55^\\circ\\quad \\text{(C) } 60^\\circ\\quad \\text{(D) } 65^\\circ\\quad \\text{(E) } 70^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"346\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We first consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/c/7cc1a19a004754af5a3459c905ca7b927f04b0b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CBA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/e/dde5d19c2d53036538d6c6ed5d50d076b5dfc16d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A = 55$\" width=\"68\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/5/3b5b6864f13d85341e28195c9d8c6eeadd372e49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C = 75$\" width=\"69\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/7/6779dc2ba8344e1a648c439022169ce5f6038762.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B = 180 - 55 - 75 = 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"201\" height=\"13\" />. Then, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/0/f007680c47a068a3aef3f4c57e9484da78281a63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BED$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> is isosceles, we have the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/0/f40a4d1db41e19e7c870c2188b0dc26ef9b1244f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\angle BED + 50 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"158\" height=\"14\" />. Solving this equation gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/f/ecfe25cbaafdf51cb03cd6f1aa29aadca575854a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BED = 65 \\rightarrow \\fbox{\\textbf{(D)}65}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"187\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME\" title=\"1993 AHSME\">1993 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"